1
00:00:04,728 --> 00:00:08,038
(Raj:)I think you'd be pleased to hear that
this morning in the parking garage,

2
00:00:08,198 --> 00:00:10,908
(Raj:)I saw this oil stain on the ground
that was shaped just like

3
00:00:11,068 --> 00:00:14,918
(Raj:)my ex-girlfriend, Lucy,
and I didn't get upset at all.

4
00:00:15,072 --> 00:00:17,072
(Howard:)I'm proud of you.

5
00:00:17,241 --> 00:00:19,881
(Raj:)Well, you should be,
'cause she was looking good.

6
00:00:20,577 --> 00:00:23,887
Dear Lord!
You're an astronomer.

7
00:00:24,048 --> 00:00:27,898
(Sheldon:)Although you may have earthly woes,
get your mind back on the stars.

8
00:00:28,052 --> 00:00:31,192
(Sheldon:)Gee, even the lowly dung beetle
chooses to plot its course

9
00:00:31,355 --> 00:00:33,665
(Sheldon:)-by using the Milky Way.
-Is that true?

10
00:00:33,824 --> 00:00:36,434
(Sheldon:)Everything I say is true.

11
00:00:36,593 --> 00:00:38,903
(Sheldon:)Now, of course,
the dung beetle also enjoys

12
00:00:39,063 --> 00:00:43,413
eating feces, living in feces
and making little balls out of feces.

13
00:00:43,567 --> 00:00:47,037
(Sheldon:)So, you know, pick and choose
which aspects of its lifestyle

14
00:00:47,204 --> 00:00:48,704
(Sheldon:)you want to embrace.

15
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:51,790
(Howard:)Come on, you can talk to girls now.

16
00:00:51,942 --> 00:00:54,012
(Howard:)It shouldn't be hard for you
to meet someone new.

17
00:00:54,178 --> 00:00:57,858
(Raj:)How can I meet someone new when
everywhere I look, I see Lucy's face?

18
00:00:58,015 --> 00:01:03,025
(Raj:)Tell me you don't see her smile
in the crust of this chicken pot pie.

